Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:14.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:15.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:26.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:27.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,被關起來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠毫髮無傷的出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:33.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我很擔心小貓有沒有被牽扯進來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:35.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定在這裡面的某處吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:36.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小貓
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:39.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是擔心貓的時候嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,又來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:47.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要去救Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:51.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 要怎麼救...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:07.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:10.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,也太大了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:12.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:13.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:14.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
