Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:14.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雖為敵人 令人佩服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:16.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,彌諾彤彤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:21.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小貓 能夠平安找到你 太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:24.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經查到住在洋房的人家了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:27.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,問題在於要怎麼找到他們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:30.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 我一定會找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理穗 別悶悶不樂的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定還在的 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪絨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是這隻小貓的名字吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理穗！瑪絨 是瑪絨！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那隻布娃娃 是她最喜歡的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在搬家的時候給落下了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們又抽不出時間 回來這邊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別哭了 理穗 我們找到瑪絨了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:20.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪絨 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:27.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:36.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“我一直在等你喵"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪絨！我好想你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪絨 對不起 把你落下了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後要永遠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪絨...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.76,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵 拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:05.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有尋找物主的必要了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:08.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠重逢 大團圓！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:11.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 是不是有點難過？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:15.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒關係的！因為瑪絨他很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝喵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:21:59.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,布娃娃 真好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:00.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Summer！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:09.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,960)}夏日愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.87,0:22:12.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起艷陽高照吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.15,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,說到夏天 那就得是大海！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗 你有見過海嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.37,0:23:51.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在電視上見過！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:53.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是有點大的湖吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:54.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定會驚訝的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.52,0:23:57.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,很期待小晴的反映呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:00.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:00.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:02.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,波瀾壯闊的大海！海濱樂園！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:04.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:09.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:17.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:22.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:26.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.23,0:02:32.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:37.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:43.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:47.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:51.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:51.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:58.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:03.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:08.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:13.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:16.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:24.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
